<tbody>
<tr><td>search:{id}</td><td class="warn">mixed · likely bug</td><td class="n" data-v="0.4000">40%</td><td>40% of 1.0K keys never expire, while the rest expire in about a day. A write path probably skips EXPIRE.</td></tr>
